# Pages

See `rule/pages.md`.

- Client feature pages use `"use client"` and `useStore()`.
- Layout: `mx-auto max-w-* space-y-*`, `h1`, one-line description.
- Forms: local `useState`, validate, then one store call.
- `confirm()` before delete or reset.
- `useSearchParams` needs `Suspense` (see `src/app/appointments/page.js`).
- Area filters: deepest level from ward up to lok_sabha, then `inArea`. Do not equality-match one geoPath key only.
- After `upsertContact` on create, route to `/contacts/{id}`.
